-- src:8182 | (e) whether any stage of those proceedings was improper or vexatious;
-- src:8183 | (f) any representations made by the Attorney General; and
-- src:8184 | (g) any other relevant matter.
@ref s 462.34(5.2)(a) to (g) (src:8177-8184)
GIVEN matter IS A `s 462.34(5.2) matter`
