`s 462.34(5.2) the judge must take the matter into account in taxing the legal fees` MEANS
    CONSIDER matter
    WHEN `s 462.34(5.2) a matter that is not relevant` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "any other relevant matter"
    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- src:8192 | (7) Sections 354, 355.2 and 355.4 do not apply to a person who comes into possession of any property that, by virtue of an order made under paragraph (4)(c), was returned to any person after having been seized or was excluded from the application of a restraint order made under subsection 462.33(3).
@ref s 462.34(7) (src:8192)
