    IF `the person comes into possession of any property that, by virtue of an order made under paragraph (4)(c), was returned to any person after having been seized or was excluded from the application of a restraint order made under subsection 462.33(3)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Sections 354, 355.2 and 355.4 do not apply to a person who comes into possession of any property that"

-- src:8193 | (8) [Repealed, 2019, c. 25, s. 182]
@ref s 462.34(8), shown repealed (src:8193)
